    {
      "id": "p0242-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "If the player can survive against Sans for long enough, Sans will grow visibly exhausted. At this point, the player can choose to spare Sans rather than defeat him. It's all a trick, though - Sans isn't actually tired and will launch a lethal surprise attack upon being spared. On the resulting game over screen, Sans shouts in English:",
        "raw": "If the player can survive against Sans for long enough, Sans will grow visibly\nexhausted. At this point, the player can choose to spare Sans rather than defeat\nhim. It's all a trick, though - Sans isn't actually tired and will launch a lethal\nsurprise attack upon being spared. On the resulting game over screen, Sans\nshouts in English:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
