    {
      "id": "p0242-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Unfortunately, there's no direct equivalent of the phrase \"get dunked on\" in Japanese. The localization team cycled through a number of potential Japanese replacements, most of which were variations on \"ha, I fooled you\" or insults based on Internet slang. Nothing quite had the same \"bite\" as the original English quote, however.",
        "raw": "Unfortunately, there's no direct equivalent of the phrase \"get dunked on\" in\nJapanese. The localization team cycled through a number of potential Japanese\nreplacements, most of which were variations on \"ha, I fooled you\" or insults\nbased on Internet slang. Nothing quite had the same \"bite\" as the original\nEnglish quote, however.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29481456,
          0.55855714,
          0.90071732,
          0.64380714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
